[I] Common interface layer between applications and speech synthesizers

[T] Speech Dispatcher provides a high-level, device independent layer for
[T] access to speech synthesis through a simple, stable and well documented
[T] interface, allowing applications to share speech synthesizer resources and
[T] helping blind and visually impaired users work with free software.

[U] https://github.com/brailcom/speechd

[A] Brailcom, o.p.s.
